initialVendorRequest.body:
Dear Vendor,

We have a quote request for the following customer:

Customer Number: {{customerNumber}}
Quote ID: {{quoteId}}
Request Date: {{requestDate}}

Please find the detailed quote request attached. We would appreciate your response within 48 hours.

If you need any additional information, please don't hesitate to contact us.

Best regards,
OEM Quote Management Team

Note: This is an automated message. If you have already provided this quote through other means (phone, separate email), please reply to this email with 'QUOTE PROVIDED' to avoid follow-up messages.

followUpReminder.body:
Dear Vendor,

This is a follow-up on the quote request we sent {{hoursElapsed}} hours ago for:

Customer Number: {{customerNumber}}
Quote ID: {{quoteId}}
Original Request Date: {{requestDate}}

If you have already provided the quote through other means (phone, separate email), please ignore this automated follow-up.

Otherwise, we would appreciate your response at your earliest convenience.

Thank you,
OEM Quote Management Team

